     "content_html": "Simple eukaryotes have genome sizes similar to bacteria."
    },
    {
     "id": 1194914,
     "content_html": "The genome sizes of different animals are roughly similar."
    },
    {
     "id": 1194917,
     "content_html": "Mammals have much larger genomes than simpler animals."
    }
